### PolicyFlow requests for the VS Code "REST Client" extension or PhpStorm HTTP client.
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Create (201), run again for 200
# @name create
POST {{base}}/api/policy-requests
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

< ../requests/create-example.json

### Read with audit trail
GET {{base}}/api/policy-requests/{{create.response.body.data.id}}
Accept: application/json

### Submit (start or safely resume issuance)
POST {{base}}/api/policy-requests/{{create.response.body.data.id}}/submit
Accept: application/json

### List with filter and pagination
GET {{base}}/api/policy-requests?status=ISSUED&per_page=10&page=1
Accept: application/json

### Mock insurer: deliver pending callbacks (DELAYED_CALLBACK / DUPLICATE_CALLBACK)
POST {{base}}/api/mock-insurer/deliver-callbacks
Accept: application/json

### Mock insurer: provider status lookup by policy request id
GET {{base}}/api/mock-insurer/policies/{{create.response.body.data.id}}
Accept: application/json
